iki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(w)\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\">\\(M(w)\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\)</span> 是下述兼容排版谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.3}\\vdash\n\\langle M,w\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}},\\ w\\in\\mathbf2^*)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.3}\\vdash\n\\langle M,w\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}},\\ w\\in\\mathbf2^*)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.3}\\vdash\nM(w)\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\leftrightarrow w\\in L(M),\\qquad\nL_u\\coloneqq\\{\\langle M,w\\rangle:M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\land M(w)\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.3}\\vdash\nM(w)\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\leftrightarrow w\\in L(M),\\qquad\nL_u\\coloneqq\\{\\langle M,w\\rangle:M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\land w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\land M(w)\\,\\mathrm{Accept}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应第三版的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","